*> vybe-test: cobol/programs/temperature_converter
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_programs.rs

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TEMPCONV.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-CELSIUS    PIC S9(5)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-FAHRENHEIT PIC S9(5)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-I          PIC S9(5) VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 0 BY 10 UNTIL WS-I > 100
        MOVE WS-I TO WS-CELSIUS
        COMPUTE WS-FAHRENHEIT = (WS-CELSIUS * 9 / 5) + 32
        DISPLAY WS-CELSIUS " C = " WS-FAHRENHEIT " F"
    END-PERFORM.
    STOP RUN.

